EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello,

Your account has now moved into default as the information required to set up a Temporary Modification was not been received. In order to move the account out of a default and into a Modification, please send the statements that were previously requested. If you are unsure of what is required, please let us know.



Thank you,

{!User.Name} | {!User.Title}

{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
P: {!User.Phone} | F: {!User.Fax}
E: {!User.Email}
